# A book neither library has as anything but a PDF. It is not in a list until it
# is asked for, and when it is, the row and the book both say PDF. The filter is
# on the filters screen, where it is reachable whatever the catalogue sent.
clean
tap Categories
wait-for Browse by subject
tap Enfant, adolescent et enseignement
wait-for Filters
expect Enfant, adolescent et enseignement
expect-missing Le guide illustré du potager
clean
tap Filters
wait-for Format
expect Order
expect Format
expect Include PDF
clean
tap Include PDF
tap Done
wait-for Le guide illustré du potager
# The list reports what was applied without being opened again.
expect PDF included
expect PDF
clean
tap Le guide illustré du potager
wait-for Book details
expect PDF only, hard to read here
expect Available now at Montréal
clean
tap Back
wait-for PDF included
tap Filters
wait-for Include PDF
tap Include PDF
tap Done
wait-for Les triplettes - Tome 1
expect-missing Le guide illustré du potager
clean
